Chapter 2 Assignment

Problem → AI Solution Worksheet

Total: 50 Points

Purpose

The purpose of this assignment is to help you connect a real-world business problem with an appropriate AI or machine learning solution.

You do not need to write Python code.

You do not need to build a machine learning model.

Your job is to think like a business professional who is deciding:

"Can AI help solve this problem, and if so, how?"

Part 1 — Understand the Business Problem — 10 Points

Choose one business problem from the following or from your domain:

Fraud detection
Customer churn
Credit scoring
Demand forecasting
Product recommendation
Employee turnover
Sales forecasting
Customer segmentation
Inventory management
Marketing campaign targeting
Answer:

What is the business problem?
A company needs to have inventory to meet customer demand. too much of said inventory adds to storage cost. Too little causes stockouts and a loss of sales. Ai is used to predict inventory needed
Why is this problem important to the organization?
Good inventory management is 90% of the battle in supply chain, It saves money and improves customer relation. It can prevent or eliminate stockouts and having too much inventory.

Who is affected by this problem?
Supply chain managers, purchaseing managers, inventory managers, sales managers, warehouse workers, customers, shipping companies

Customers
Employees
Managers
Sales teams
Finance department
Marketing department
Part 2 — Identify the Data — 10 Points

Think about what information an AI system would need.

Complete:

Question

Your Answer

What data would you need? sales, inventory, lead times, seasonal demand, industry trends

Where could the data come from? Company inventory, sales figures, news, weather,

How much historical data might be useful? 2 years minumim, prefereably 5+

What would be the most important variables? Sales, inventoryy, lead times, seasonality,

What could be missing or inaccurate? Bad inventory counts or off the record sales could seriously effect numbers

